algorithms.pseudocode:
function CheckDiophantine(omega, K, C):
    min_gap = infinity
    for norm = 1 to K:
        for each k in Z^n with ||k||_1 = norm:
            gap = |<k, omega>|
            min_gap = min(min_gap, gap)
            if gap < C: return (False, k)
    return (True, min_gap)

Complexity: Time O(K^n * n), Space O(n)
